<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns &quot;Aaa&quot; rating to Chubu Elec's bond.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns &quot;Aaa&quot; rating to Chubu Elec's bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday that it has assigned its &quot;Aaa&quot; rating to Chubu Electric Power Co Inc's 50 billion yen 3.125 percent straight bond due in 2017.</p>
</text>
